      "visualType": "markdownCard",
      "markdownText": "**SourceType**\n\nSourceType: Source storage backend, such as Local, Blob, BlobFS (Data Lake Storage), File, FileNFS, S3, or GCP, derived from FromTo. Aggregate Sources lists the observed source backend types.\n\n**DestType**\n\nDestType: Destination storage backend, such as Local, Blob, BlobFS, File, FileNFS, S3, or GCP; derived from the destination half of FromTo.\n\n**TargetType**\n\nTargetType is the aggregate alias of DestType; Targets lists the observed destination backend types. DestType: Destination storage backend, such as Local, Blob, BlobFS, File, FileNFS, S3, or GCP; derived from the destination half of FromTo.",
